            "text": "<p>We are living at a turning point in human evolution. New discoveries in neuroscience, biology, and the field of human potential reveal a truth long preserved in ancient wisdom traditions: <br/><strong>you already possess extraordinary capacities for healing, intuition, resilience, and creation.</strong></p><p>In this intimate, one-day workshop, Gregg Braden guides you through the science and practices that awaken these natural abilities—empowering you to navigate life with greater clarity, coherence, and purpose.</p><p>This is your invitation to remember who you truly are.</p>"
          }
