          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Event Terms and Conditions Summary",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>By completing your registration, you acknowledge and agree to the event terms and conditions.</p><p><strong>Event Changes & Cancellations</strong><br/><br/>Event dates, schedules, or programming may change due to circumstances beyond our control, including severe weather, travel disruptions, public health restrictions, or other unforeseen events. Gaia and its partners reserve the right to postpone or cancel the event if necessary.<br/><br/>If the event is canceled, payments will be refunded <strong>minus a 5% administrative fee</strong>. No additional compensation, reimbursements, or claims for damages, loss of time, or inconvenience will be granted.</p><p>If the event is postponed, your payment will be applied to the new dates. If you are unable to attend the rescheduled date, the same cancellation fee applies.</p><p>If an interruption occurs <strong>during</strong> the event (e.g., government shutdown, emergency conditions), unused portions of the event are <strong>not refundable</strong>.</p><p><strong>Presenter Availability</strong><br/><br/>In the unlikely event that Gregg Braden cannot participate due to circumstances outside his control, the presenter and his representatives will make every effort to reschedule.<br/><br/>If the event ultimately must be canceled, the standard cancellation policy applies.</p><p><strong>Liability & Participant Responsibility</strong><br/><br/>Participation in this event involves inherent risks. By registering, you agree to assume all risks associated with attendance and release Gaia, its partners, and affiliates from liability for injury, illness, death, loss, or damages to person or property, regardless of cause.<br/><br/>Gaia is not responsible for delays, schedule changes, transportation issues, natural events, political conditions, or acts of third parties.<br/><br/>You are responsible for your own medical and travel insurance; none is provided by Gaia.</p><p><strong>Behavior & Participation</strong><br/><br/>The event organizer reserves the right to refuse or remove any participant whose behavior disrupts the event. No refunds will be issued in such cases. If a participant chooses to leave the event early, no refunds are provided.</p><p>*This workshop is delivered by our event partner. Completing your purchase confirms your agreement to the provider’s Terms & Conditions and acknowledges that all onsite workshop operations are managed by the event organizer.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
